WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.880
<v NARRATOR>High in the old oak tree, a
little owl called Pip could not sleep.

00:00:07.541 --> 00:00:11.481
<v PIP>Mama says owls love the dark. But I
don't. Not even a little bit.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:17.257
<v NARRATOR>Then, just past the end of her
beak, something tiny began to glow.

00:00:20.032 --> 00:00:23.752
<v GLOW>Hello! I'm Glow. I light up when I'm
happy. Watch!

00:00:25.423 --> 00:00:27.243
<v PIP>You're a star? A tiny, flying star?

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:33.420
<v GLOW>Even better. I'm a firefly! And the
dark is my favourite place to shine.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:36.333
<v PIP>But what if something's out there?

00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:40.664
<v GLOW>Then we'll look at it together. Look
up.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:49.155
<v NARRATOR>Pip looked up. And there, above
the branches, a thousand little lights

00:00:49.155 --> 00:00:50.555
were blinking hello.

00:00:52.481 --> 00:00:54.601
<v PIP>Oh. The dark is full of friends.

00:00:58.535 --> 00:00:59.295
<v PIP>Goodnight, Glow.

00:01:01.342 --> 00:01:07.362
<v NARRATOR>And with Glow beside her, Pip
closed her eyes. Goodnight, little owl.
